services.claude_session_store.doc:
Isolate and retire Claude CLI transcripts for protected workflows.

Claude CLI persists the complete stdin prompt in JSONL.  A shared
``CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR`` therefore becomes a long-lived plaintext copy of every
Skill prompt.  Each managed workspace gets a deterministic, private config
directory instead.  The directory remains available while a workflow is
running/paused and is retired only after the workflow has committed a
``completed`` state.

Deletion is deliberately fail-safe:

* paths are derived from a SHA-256 workspace identity, never caller input;
* the session root and target must not be symlinks/junctions;
* a strict ownership marker must match before a tree can be removed;
* an in-use reference count defers cleanup until the last Claude call exits;
* marker-less residue is kept untouched; a bounded, separately owned recovery
  generation restores availability without importing untrusted cached state;
* removal first renames into a private quarantine, so a crash can be repaired
  on the next application start without exposing a half-deleted live session.

methods.doc:
Change stream position.

Seek to byte offset pos relative to position indicated by whence:
     0  Start of stream (the default).  pos should be >= 0;
     1  Current position - pos may be negative;
     2  End of stream - pos usually negative.
Returns the new absolute position.

services.extract_worker.doc:
异步文本提取 worker.

每个工作流 / 上传目录用一个独立的状态文件 `.extract_status.json` 跟踪进度.
提取任务跑在 asyncio 后台 task, 不阻塞 HTTP 响应.

状态文件结构:
{
    "version": 1,
    "files": {
        "原文件名.pdf": {
            "status": "pending" | "extracting" | "done" | "failed",
            "started_at": 1234567890,        # done/failed 时是结束时间
            "duration_ms": 1234,             # 仅 done/failed
            "extracted_path": "原文件名_extracted.txt",   # 仅 done
            "extracted_chars": 12345,        # 仅 done
            "error": "...",                  # 仅 failed
        }
    }
}

